{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Victory</strong> is a World War 2 military simulation wargame based on history. It blends realistic data with practical play creating a moderately complex game that focused on depth of strategy to win. Play any of the major powers during that time period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the developer of WarPlan. Based on ideas from players and games such as ADG's World in Flames, SPI's ETO, GMT's A World at War, and many others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uses a modified Mercator map and a tile system for an elegant readable map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production uses ore into industry that creates material from factories</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated supply system of ports and sources along routes that adds another level of strategic play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hex holds 1 land, 1 naval, and 1 air counter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Land counters can hold up to 6 units</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Air counters can hold up to 4 units</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Naval counters at sea can hold up to 6 units, unlimited in port</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single capital ships researched with historical data</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new units, improvements in combat, and intelligence with 20+ research slots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful silhouettes for infantry, tanks, and ships unique for each nation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more complaining spouses. No more cats ruining your game. No more worn counters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PBEM, Hotseat, or computer opponent.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play any number of major powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say no to RTS Hearts of Iron micromanagement. Say YES to strategy and less clicking.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3359110?t=1771536260","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359110/3f4d44ed663216c1d3597f525bc6553c42c8ccec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771536260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359110/83bed97683fcc4d68e2d509a29c4eb0ce9406b49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771536260","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359110/83bed97683fcc4d68e2d509a29c4eb0ce9406b49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771536260","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Victory</strong> is a World War 2 military simulation wargame based on history. It blends realistic data with practical play creating a moderately complex game that focused on depth of strategy to win. Play any of the major powers during that time period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the developer of WarPlan. Based on ideas from players and games such as ADG's World in Flames, SPI's ETO, GMT's A World at War, and many others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uses a modified Mercator map and a tile system for an elegant readable map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production uses ore into industry that creates material from factories</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated supply system of ports and sources along routes that adds another level of strategic play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hex holds 1 land, 1 naval, and 1 air counter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Land counters can hold up to 6 units</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Air counters can hold up to 4 units</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Naval counters at sea can hold up to 6 units, unlimited in port</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single capital ships researched with historical data</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new units, improvements in combat, and intelligence with 20+ research slots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful silhouettes for infantry, tanks, and ships unique for each nation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more complaining spouses. No more cats ruining your game. No more worn counters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PBEM, Hotseat, or computer opponent.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play any number of major powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say no to RTS Hearts of Iron micromanagement. Say YES to strategy and less clicking.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Kraken Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359110/a4f11efbeb2ab83314b4486e997e04fe7a1fd1d8/header.jpg?t=1771536260","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3359110/1719244117/4696b45c88aca397141dd326de56ecd304f351bb/1771198246/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771201012","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3359110/1719244117/4696b45c88aca397141dd326de56ecd304f351bb/1771198246/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771201012","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3359110/1719244117/4696b45c88aca397141dd326de56ecd304f351bb/1771198246/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771201012","id":257287832,"name":"Total Victory: World Conflict 1939-1945","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257287832/04068b03f5018dd00fb3c52119f69e7b731960af/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771201012"}],"name":"Total Victory: World Conflict 1939-1945","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and Windows 11, 64-bit versions only.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Kraken Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"stea